WEBVTT

01:26.460 --> 01:29.730
[Glory]

01:30.700 --> 01:32.930
[Episode 8]

01:46.789 --> 01:47.310
What?

01:48.759 --> 01:50.310
For a mere servant,

01:51.200 --> 01:53.130
Miss Rong is interrogating me now?

01:55.400 --> 01:56.310
Who said Mr. Lu

01:56.310 --> 01:58.039
is a servant of the Rong family?

01:58.350 --> 01:59.210
Steward Cheng,

01:59.870 --> 02:02.600
does our household have
his indenture contract?

02:02.780 --> 02:03.340
No.

02:04.150 --> 02:05.870
Since there's no indenture contract,

02:05.870 --> 02:06.870
he is a free man.

02:07.680 --> 02:10.320
Mr. Yang, you should speak
with more respect.

02:10.810 --> 02:12.870
What does it matter
if he's a free man?

02:13.220 --> 02:15.450
People get hurt and die
in martial arts arena all the time.

02:15.450 --> 02:17.050
My shoulder was injured too.

02:17.710 --> 02:19.550
Blood had soaked through my clothes.

02:19.550 --> 02:21.950
Who can I complain to
about this injustice?

02:21.960 --> 02:23.280
Just a scratch,

02:23.630 --> 02:25.050
and he's hiding behind a woman

02:25.050 --> 02:26.560
while lording it over everyone.

02:26.560 --> 02:27.890
What kind of man are you?

02:28.130 --> 02:28.890
Well, you...

02:29.320 --> 02:31.400
You hurt someone
and still speak such vile words.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.800
You're far too arrogant.

02:33.520 --> 02:35.750
A real man is one
who poisons his blade

02:36.260 --> 02:38.840
and schemes tirelessly to kill?

02:39.560 --> 02:41.960
Such a real man,
being so ruthless and vile,

02:42.510 --> 02:43.190
I think,

02:45.240 --> 02:47.170
I'd better off not being one at all.

02:47.329 --> 02:49.329
This is clearly a false accusation!

02:49.360 --> 02:50.220
Yang Dingchen,

02:50.560 --> 02:51.590
no matter how wronged you feel,

02:51.590 --> 02:52.690
you should just talk about it.

02:52.690 --> 02:54.150
Don't frighten my cousin.

02:55.260 --> 02:57.030
Truth is only revealed through debate.

02:57.030 --> 02:59.240
Resorting to force is a vulgar descent.

02:59.940 --> 03:00.710
Mr. Yang,

03:01.950 --> 03:03.280
do not be impudent here.

03:09.200 --> 03:09.800
Take this.

03:21.430 --> 03:21.990
No way.

03:22.240 --> 03:24.370
Manzhu, go invite Doctor Zhao, hurry.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.560
Yes, Miss Rong.

03:27.520 --> 03:28.780
Stop putting on an act.

03:29.410 --> 03:31.140
When did I ever poison my sword?

03:31.400 --> 03:33.210
It's you, pretty boy, who's lying!

03:33.210 --> 03:34.370
Let go! Let me go!

03:35.560 --> 03:36.190
Miss Rong.

03:36.800 --> 03:38.710
This is slander and a setup.

03:40.000 --> 03:41.260
You can't believe him.

03:42.270 --> 03:42.940
Show him.

03:43.200 --> 03:43.690
Yes.

03:48.550 --> 03:50.400
You issued the challenge yourself.

03:50.400 --> 03:52.560
The weapon that caused the injury
was your favorite sword.

03:52.560 --> 03:55.200
We have the doctor's testimony
and physical evidence too.

03:55.200 --> 03:56.730
How could anyone frame you?

03:56.800 --> 03:58.530
Would someone really frame you

03:59.260 --> 04:00.950
by risking their own life?

04:03.170 --> 04:04.360
Perhaps someone

04:04.360 --> 04:05.760
is lying behind our back.

04:06.940 --> 04:07.660
It's you?

04:09.040 --> 04:10.400
It's you?

04:11.120 --> 04:12.120
Or you?

04:13.840 --> 04:14.520
Fine.

04:15.010 --> 04:16.120
You're all ganging up

04:16.120 --> 04:17.190
against me alone.

04:17.480 --> 04:19.110
When a thousand fingers point at someone,

04:19.110 --> 04:21.110
even the innocent can drown in spit.

04:21.550 --> 04:23.070
Those with clear consciences

04:23.070 --> 04:24.670
don't fear midnight knocks.

04:24.740 --> 04:26.310
If you truly have nothing to hide,

04:26.310 --> 04:27.710
why fear confronting us?

04:28.230 --> 04:30.520
Only mad dogs bite randomly.

04:30.550 --> 04:31.020
You...

04:31.870 --> 04:33.000
I'm kindly enough to try to help you.

04:33.000 --> 04:35.130
How does it have anything to do with me?

04:38.120 --> 04:39.120
This is evidence.

04:39.180 --> 04:40.780
We can testify as witnesses.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.680
Once we go to court,

04:42.870 --> 04:45.040
you'll surely
be charged with attempted murder.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.159
According to our dynasty's law,

04:46.159 --> 04:48.420
those who plot murder shall be beheaded.

04:49.120 --> 04:51.780
Those who injure
but don't kill shall be hanged.

04:52.350 --> 04:54.750
See? How should this be handled?

05:00.100 --> 05:00.810
Miss Rong.

05:02.270 --> 05:04.130
I have treated you with sincerity

05:04.750 --> 05:07.210
and came to
propose with honest intentions.

05:07.740 --> 05:08.870
You must believe me.

05:09.490 --> 05:11.010
I was set up by someone.

05:11.630 --> 05:12.960
If you apply the poison,

05:13.270 --> 05:13.870
then you are

05:13.870 --> 05:15.800
a scheming, treacherous villain.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.730
If you were framed,

05:18.100 --> 05:20.430
you couldn't even
protect your own sword,

05:20.520 --> 05:23.240
so how could you protect Miss Rong
and the Rong family?

05:23.240 --> 05:25.240
Either you're evil or incompetent.

05:25.460 --> 05:27.140
Is this Mr. Yang's sincerity?

05:27.440 --> 05:27.970
You...

05:36.750 --> 05:37.630
Miss Rong.

05:38.840 --> 05:41.570
The Rong and the Yang families
have business dealings

05:41.570 --> 05:42.830
and deep connections.

05:43.430 --> 05:44.680
How do I matter?

05:45.630 --> 05:47.960
Let's pretend this never happened today.

05:48.409 --> 05:50.409
I can endure this slight injustice.

05:51.750 --> 05:54.480
Don't ruin the friendship
between two families.

05:58.800 --> 05:59.560
Mr. Yang.

06:00.800 --> 06:01.430
If it weren't for the histories

06:01.430 --> 06:03.830
and connections between our two families,

06:04.040 --> 06:06.300
I wouldn't be the one handling this case.

06:06.970 --> 06:07.650
Miss Rong.

06:13.280 --> 06:14.810
Young Master, think twice.

06:15.220 --> 06:17.000
We have witnesses and evidence.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.200
If this goes to court,

06:18.270 --> 06:20.150
it will cause
a scandal throughout the city.

06:20.150 --> 06:22.810
You'll not only fail in marriage
but'll also experience more disgrace.

06:22.810 --> 06:25.640
Think and act wisely, Young Master.

06:32.240 --> 06:32.840
I told you,

06:33.310 --> 06:34.710
I'll handle this matter.

06:34.980 --> 06:36.310
No need for you to worry.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.470
Take good care of your wound.

06:42.920 --> 06:44.950
Yang Dingchen, don't you still understand?

06:44.950 --> 06:47.810
Do you want to
be bound and sent to the County Office?

06:49.680 --> 06:52.680
Miss Rong, since you choose to
listen to only one side,

06:53.630 --> 06:55.090
I have nothing more to say.

06:57.030 --> 06:57.960
You injured him.

07:00.660 --> 07:02.390
Are you just leaving like this?

07:14.040 --> 07:14.830
I apologize.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.160
I'll have someone deliver

07:17.160 --> 07:18.560
the compensation money.

07:31.800 --> 07:34.630
Thank you all for standing up

07:36.870 --> 07:37.840
for justice.

07:58.520 --> 07:59.320
Young Master.

08:05.440 --> 08:06.270
It's you?

08:11.540 --> 08:12.610
Who is he to you

08:12.720 --> 08:14.150
that you personally treated his illness

08:14.150 --> 08:15.740
and even gave him
the longevity pill, Young Master?

08:15.740 --> 08:16.660
What a waste!

08:17.600 --> 08:19.300
We're both guests at Rong Mansion.

08:19.300 --> 08:20.630
Our meeting is destiny.

08:21.130 --> 08:21.750
When I clearly have

08:21.750 --> 08:23.360
good medication to cleanse poison
and heal wounds,

08:23.360 --> 08:25.120
how could I turn a blind eye to him?

08:25.120 --> 08:27.120
What kind of person do you think I am?

08:27.180 --> 08:29.070
Young Master, you're too kind-hearted.

08:29.070 --> 08:30.510
Not all guests are equal.

08:30.750 --> 08:31.870
That freeloader at Rong family

08:31.870 --> 08:33.090
is just a penniless outsider,

08:33.090 --> 08:34.919
how could he be compared to Young Master?

08:34.919 --> 08:35.980
You are Lady Rong's

08:35.990 --> 08:38.120
personally chosen grandson-in-law.

08:39.120 --> 08:39.840
Don't talk nonsense.

08:39.840 --> 08:40.419
Don't run!

08:40.419 --> 08:41.880
It's only a matter of time.

08:42.100 --> 08:42.700
Come here!

08:47.350 --> 08:48.180
Mr. Yan, help!

08:48.440 --> 08:50.240
My Young Master wants to kill me!

08:50.240 --> 08:52.360
If you didn't add the poison,
then who did?

08:52.360 --> 08:53.200
Come here now!

08:54.880 --> 08:56.150
Mr. Yan, please show mercy

08:56.150 --> 08:57.030
and save me!

08:58.050 --> 08:59.100
You won't come?

09:06.180 --> 09:07.030
It must be this wretch

09:07.030 --> 09:08.910
who resented Lu for releasing the snake

09:08.910 --> 09:10.510
and caused all this trouble.

09:10.620 --> 09:11.510
Today I must

09:11.510 --> 09:12.750
punish him severely.

09:13.080 --> 09:14.010
Get out of my way!

09:24.050 --> 09:25.910
Quickly, invite the doctor over!

10:03.240 --> 10:05.000
Miss... Miss Rong!

10:05.270 --> 10:06.330
What are you doing?

10:06.630 --> 10:08.090
You're as cunning as a fox,

10:08.600 --> 10:11.230
how could you be completely
off guard against Yang Dingchen?

10:11.230 --> 10:12.680
If you really got poisoned,

10:12.680 --> 10:13.740
show me your wound.

10:15.950 --> 10:16.470
I...

10:16.500 --> 10:18.430
I risked my life for you, Miss Rong,

10:19.080 --> 10:20.880
and finally removed your thorn.

10:21.030 --> 10:22.920
You should be thanking me, Miss Rong.

10:22.920 --> 10:24.670
Yet you're suspicious of me?

10:25.330 --> 10:27.060
I just want to check your wound.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.500
Why are you so nervous?

10:29.630 --> 10:31.270
Men and women should keep their distance.

10:31.270 --> 10:33.080
Miss Rong, you absolutely can't do this.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.540
If others were to see this,

10:35.370 --> 10:36.790
it'd be most inappropriate.

10:36.790 --> 10:38.630
Our family doesn't have such rules.

10:38.630 --> 10:39.360
Let go.

10:47.440 --> 10:48.820
Hurry! He's vomiting blood!

10:48.820 --> 10:50.080
I'm afraid he won't...

10:57.230 --> 10:57.960
Doctor Zhao!

10:58.430 --> 10:59.390
In my presence,

10:59.920 --> 11:01.320
examine his wound again.

11:03.720 --> 11:04.360
Miss Rong.

11:06.080 --> 11:06.600
You...

11:08.600 --> 11:10.400
Do you really not trust me at all?

11:17.670 --> 11:18.440
Miss Rong.

11:18.800 --> 11:19.830
Lady Rong requests Young Master

11:19.830 --> 11:21.760
to go to Chongxi Hall immediately.

11:26.550 --> 11:27.320
See?

11:28.550 --> 11:30.920
Your tricks may fool others,

11:31.490 --> 11:33.260
but they won't fool my Grandmother.

11:33.260 --> 11:34.750
That's truly
bringing trouble upon yourself,

11:34.750 --> 11:36.600
and cutting off your own path to survival.

11:36.600 --> 11:40.030
Is Lady Rong really that frightening?

11:42.210 --> 11:43.480
Grandmother despises nothing more than men

11:43.480 --> 11:45.160
who stir up trouble out of jealousy.

11:45.160 --> 11:47.160
It's a disaster that you can't escape.

11:47.160 --> 11:47.800
Let's go.

12:25.030 --> 12:27.290
I, Fusheng, pay my respects to Lady Rong.

12:31.770 --> 12:33.010
It was my fault.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.490
I saw that he was all alone in this world,

12:35.490 --> 12:36.890
with no family to rely on,

12:37.040 --> 12:39.500
so I couldn't help
but take extra care of him.

12:39.760 --> 12:41.000
This angered Yang Dingchen

12:41.000 --> 12:42.370
who became extremely dissatisfied.

12:42.370 --> 12:44.360
In the competition,
Yang Dingchen poisoned his blade,

12:44.360 --> 12:45.890
which nearly killed Mr. Lu.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.720
Fortunately, Mr. Lu was forgiving enough

12:48.720 --> 12:50.720
to spare us from this legal trouble.

12:50.800 --> 12:51.440
Grandmother.

12:51.440 --> 12:51.960
Wait.

12:52.680 --> 12:54.340
I have a few questions for him.

12:54.630 --> 12:56.140
This has nothing to do with you.

12:56.140 --> 12:57.260
Stand aside.

13:03.230 --> 13:06.220
Is everything truly as she described?

13:07.670 --> 13:10.330
I'm grateful to
the Rong family for taking me in,

13:11.150 --> 13:13.680
and for Miss Rong's
kindness and compassion.

13:14.240 --> 13:15.640
I can't be more grateful.

13:16.150 --> 13:18.080
Who knew
trouble would arise out of nowhere,

13:18.080 --> 13:20.010
causing Mr. Yang to become jealous

13:20.480 --> 13:22.410
and bringing about this disaster?

13:22.510 --> 13:24.600
I deeply regret what happened

13:25.670 --> 13:27.960
and sincerely apologize to Lady Rong.

13:33.030 --> 13:34.850
Grandmother, he's seriously injured.

13:34.850 --> 13:36.380
Let him sit while he speaks.

13:44.270 --> 13:46.130
I dare not deceive you, Lady Rong.

13:46.450 --> 13:48.530
Everyone suspects Mr. Yang.

13:49.270 --> 13:50.770
Though there is indeed evidence,

13:50.770 --> 13:52.630
I still have my doubts in my heart.

13:53.120 --> 13:55.180
I've been wanting to inform Lady Rong

13:55.560 --> 13:57.160
and Miss Rong a long time ago.

14:00.000 --> 14:02.280
Mr. Yang publicly challenged me.

14:03.150 --> 14:04.030
Everyone knew that

14:04.030 --> 14:05.550
he wanted to compete with me.

14:05.550 --> 14:07.750
If someone
really died in martial arts arena,

14:07.750 --> 14:09.750
Mr. Yang would be held accountable.

14:09.900 --> 14:11.320
Though I'm not familiar with

14:11.320 --> 14:12.720
Mr. Yang's temperament,

14:13.030 --> 14:16.690
given the outstanding candidate
the Yang family has put forward,

14:16.800 --> 14:18.260
he is unlikely to be a fool.

14:20.200 --> 14:22.540
Only because he saw you
as a servant of the Rong family,

14:22.540 --> 14:24.400
whose life and death
are at his master's discretion,

14:24.400 --> 14:25.550
killing a servant

14:25.710 --> 14:27.370
would never cost him his life.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.630
That's possible.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.550
But more likely,

14:32.180 --> 14:34.840
someone wanted to
use him to do their dirty work,

14:35.940 --> 14:37.800
killing two birds with one stone.

14:41.190 --> 14:42.460
Let them in.

15:02.940 --> 15:03.570
Lady Rong.

15:04.450 --> 15:05.710
My lack of guile made me

15:06.120 --> 15:07.550
an easy target for foul play.

15:07.550 --> 15:10.410
I implore you, Lady Rong,
to uphold justice on my behalf.

15:10.410 --> 15:11.960
Tell Lady Rong exactly

15:12.420 --> 15:13.700
what you just told me.

15:14.980 --> 15:16.980
Don't worry. Just tell the truth.

15:18.240 --> 15:18.790
Yes.

15:20.000 --> 15:20.730
At that time,

15:21.840 --> 15:22.790
I was upset

15:23.580 --> 15:25.540
that the other servants
were drinking and gambling,

15:25.540 --> 15:27.830
leaving only me
to polish the master's sword.

15:27.830 --> 15:29.230
Chang Hong stood up for me

15:29.960 --> 15:30.900
and tried every possible way

15:30.900 --> 15:32.960
to trick me into giving him the sword.

15:33.120 --> 15:34.480
He is from my hometown

15:34.840 --> 15:36.440
and we've always been close.

15:36.870 --> 15:37.720
How could I know that

15:37.720 --> 15:39.960
he plotted against
our master behind his back?

15:39.960 --> 15:41.200
It was him who applied the poison.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.530
It must be him!

15:42.950 --> 15:44.390
Was the pain of
the whip not enough for you,

15:44.390 --> 15:46.520
or do you wish to try the water dungeon?

15:46.750 --> 15:48.210
Even if you had nine lives,

15:48.440 --> 15:50.430
once you're
in the Rong family dungeon, you will talk.

15:50.430 --> 15:51.890
Now, who asked you to do so?

15:57.150 --> 15:57.670
I...

16:16.720 --> 16:19.360
Mr. He, how cruel of you.

16:20.440 --> 16:22.100
Mr. Lu has done nothing to you,

16:23.010 --> 16:24.270
yet you're so vicious.

16:24.620 --> 16:25.510
He not only

16:25.510 --> 16:26.910
wants Lu Fusheng's life,

16:27.240 --> 16:29.270
but also wants me to take the blame.

16:31.480 --> 16:33.240
I issued my challenge

16:33.240 --> 16:34.200
fair and square.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.890
I disdain resorting to

16:35.920 --> 16:38.200
stabbing people
in the back with underhanded tricks

16:38.200 --> 16:38.930
Miss Rong,

16:39.980 --> 16:42.050
now you know you've wronged me?

16:57.050 --> 16:58.130
Take them away.

17:02.510 --> 17:03.110
Go.

17:04.920 --> 17:05.880
I did it.

17:06.440 --> 17:07.440
So what?

17:08.160 --> 17:10.140
I've been waiting for
your Rong family's son-in-law selection.

17:10.140 --> 17:11.520
If one wants to be the final winner,

17:11.520 --> 17:13.050
they must give it their all.

17:13.750 --> 17:14.750
Isn't that right?

17:16.800 --> 17:19.119
You're truly shameless.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.829
When did I ever tell you

17:22.349 --> 17:24.160
that if you eliminate all your opponents,

17:24.160 --> 17:24.720
you could become

17:24.720 --> 17:25.880
my husband?

17:30.510 --> 17:32.400
Those who turn upon each other

17:33.270 --> 17:35.470
when forced into close quarters
are the serpents and scorpions.

17:35.470 --> 17:37.800
What sets humanity apart from mere beasts

17:38.470 --> 17:40.790
is our capacity for knowledge and wisdom,

17:40.790 --> 17:43.190
our understanding of propriety and shame.

17:53.770 --> 17:56.140
To be exposed without feeling ashamed,

17:56.960 --> 17:58.430
yet rather
projecting your own flaws onto others

17:58.430 --> 17:59.690
and gloating about it.

18:01.790 --> 18:04.390
When the heart is crooked,
no deed can succeed.

18:04.990 --> 18:07.200
When the character is warped,
no enterprise can stand.

18:07.200 --> 18:09.600
If this is
the family motto of the He family,

18:10.110 --> 18:11.590
no wonder your Huqiu Tea

18:11.870 --> 18:13.130
falls short of others.

18:19.750 --> 18:21.270
What gives a wretched, short-lived

18:21.270 --> 18:23.180
bastard like you the right to lecture me?

18:23.180 --> 18:24.730
Say that again.

18:53.570 --> 18:54.370
Your wound...

18:57.030 --> 18:57.680
I'm fine.

18:58.270 --> 18:59.720
The fault lies entirely in

18:59.720 --> 19:00.850
my momentary indignation and rash words.

19:00.850 --> 19:02.050
I can't blame others.

19:02.700 --> 19:03.380
Miss Rong,

19:04.590 --> 19:05.680
Mr. He and Mr. Yang

19:05.790 --> 19:07.350
are both here as candidates.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.720
Please, do not let more discord arise

19:08.720 --> 19:09.680
because of me.

19:10.940 --> 19:13.070
Let's not pursue this matter further.

19:18.360 --> 19:19.270
Mr. He,

19:20.850 --> 19:21.850
I don't blame you.

19:22.920 --> 19:23.920
You may leave now.

19:24.550 --> 19:25.680
You just let that go?

19:26.290 --> 19:28.310
If kindness answers malice,
what answers kindness?

19:28.310 --> 19:29.880
How can you, Mr. Lu, indulge

19:29.880 --> 19:30.860
such a vile creature

19:30.860 --> 19:32.140
who shows no remorse?

19:32.550 --> 19:34.070
Do you intend for Lady Rong

19:34.070 --> 19:35.070
to keep him around

19:35.230 --> 19:37.160
to harm Miss Rong in the future?

19:37.480 --> 19:39.150
Your false magnanimity is your own affair.

19:39.150 --> 19:40.890
Don't be generous with
what isn't yours to give.

19:40.890 --> 19:43.550
I haven't forgotten
the grudge of being falsely accused.

19:43.550 --> 19:45.210
But what makes you any better?

19:45.480 --> 19:46.750
Which of your underhanded deeds

19:46.750 --> 19:47.960
is clean?

19:49.120 --> 19:49.910
How about I just

19:49.910 --> 19:51.730
expose them all right here and right now?

19:51.730 --> 19:53.830
Wasn't it all
your instigation to begin with!

19:53.830 --> 19:55.560
What are you all talking about?

19:57.560 --> 19:59.240
Mr. Yang and Mr. He

19:59.640 --> 20:01.140
were invited by the Rong family

20:01.140 --> 20:02.870
to attend the Tea God Festival.

20:03.650 --> 20:05.260
After enjoying the ceremony,

20:05.260 --> 20:07.390
both of you will leave the Rong family.

20:07.400 --> 20:10.130
There was never
any matter of marriage proposal.

20:11.750 --> 20:12.510
Alright.

20:13.950 --> 20:14.870
I'm tired too.

20:16.950 --> 20:20.160
Please make yourselves comfortable.

20:20.610 --> 20:21.900
How wise are you, Grandmother.

20:21.900 --> 20:23.590
Allow me to
respectfully see you out, Grandmother.

20:23.590 --> 20:24.270
Lady Rong!

20:24.880 --> 20:26.060
He Xingming was born to be wicked,

20:26.060 --> 20:27.310
plotting against
people behind their backs.

20:27.310 --> 20:28.330
But I've done nothing wrong.

20:28.330 --> 20:29.590
Why am I also being dismissed?

20:29.590 --> 20:30.270
Lady Rong!

20:37.960 --> 20:38.810
Miss Rong!

20:40.410 --> 20:42.270
I've been utterly devoted to you.

20:42.690 --> 20:43.720
Wouldn't you even

20:43.720 --> 20:45.480
say one word on my behalf?

20:46.380 --> 20:48.050
You know Mr. He's nature well,

20:48.680 --> 20:50.340
but you still get close to him.

20:50.700 --> 20:51.890
This is just like
bargaining with a tiger for its skin.

20:51.890 --> 20:52.960
You know perfectly well

20:52.960 --> 20:54.020
what you're after.

20:54.270 --> 20:54.720
I...

20:54.920 --> 20:56.550
Being impulsive and jealous is one thing,

20:56.550 --> 20:58.750
being easily
influenced by instigation is another.

20:58.750 --> 21:00.790
Grandmother naturally dislikes this.

21:00.790 --> 21:02.030
This is Chongxi Hall.

21:03.010 --> 21:04.540
Please leave immediately.

21:04.820 --> 21:06.680
Don't disturb Lady Rong's peace.

21:18.620 --> 21:19.590
So the two of us

21:19.590 --> 21:21.320
have been working for nothing.

21:21.410 --> 21:22.610
We both end up wounded

21:22.810 --> 21:24.790
while a third party reaps the benefits.

21:24.790 --> 21:27.390
So many strive
and scheme with all their might,

21:27.390 --> 21:29.220
but none can match your cunning.

21:31.530 --> 21:33.290
I, He, concede defeat.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.200
Young Master.

21:48.400 --> 21:50.720
Thank you, Mr. Yan,
for righting this wrong

21:50.720 --> 21:52.050
and upholding justice.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.000
In this world,

21:53.200 --> 21:54.910
it's rare to have good people like you.

21:54.910 --> 21:56.770
That servant ran into me himself,

21:56.840 --> 21:58.850
so I then reported to
Lady Rong for a thorough investigation.

21:58.850 --> 22:01.380
If you want to thank someone,
thank Lady Rong.

22:45.130 --> 22:46.130
Everyone, leave.

22:47.030 --> 22:47.750
-Yes!
-Yes!

23:02.690 --> 23:03.850
Miss Rong, I...

23:09.110 --> 23:11.030
Why are you upset again, Miss Rong?

23:11.030 --> 23:12.160
I'm still injured.

23:12.550 --> 23:14.440
Just now you were barely breathing

23:14.440 --> 23:15.900
as if you were about to die.

23:16.010 --> 23:18.350
But in front of Grandmother,
you were perfectly fine.

23:18.350 --> 23:19.030
You knew from the beginning

23:19.030 --> 23:20.630
it was He Xingming's scheme.

23:20.730 --> 23:22.190
Why didn't you expose him?

23:22.670 --> 23:24.310
How dare you still go fight in the arena?

23:24.310 --> 23:26.040
I took an antidote beforehand.

23:26.580 --> 23:28.240
The wound only looks frightening,

23:28.240 --> 23:29.970
but it's not actually serious.

23:30.640 --> 23:32.460
I took the disaster meant for Mr. Wen,

23:32.460 --> 23:34.460
but that was only a stopgap measure.

23:34.590 --> 23:36.070
Until the root of the trouble is removed,

23:36.070 --> 23:38.350
how can there
ever be a single day of peace?

23:38.350 --> 23:39.640
Unfortunately, Yang and He

23:39.640 --> 23:40.920
come from prestigious families.

23:40.920 --> 23:42.580
Lady Rong values them highly,

23:42.790 --> 23:44.920
and you can't
easily drive them away either, Miss Rong.

23:44.920 --> 23:46.530
With this self-sacrifice strategy,

23:46.530 --> 23:48.300
it would be easier to drive them out.

23:48.300 --> 23:49.500
Were you so confident

23:49.830 --> 23:52.030
that Grandmother would drive them out?

23:52.960 --> 23:54.480
When you're choosing a husband,

23:54.480 --> 23:56.240
you'll certainly need to
choose someone of

23:56.240 --> 23:58.160
good character and true integrity.

23:58.160 --> 23:59.690
Today in the hall, those two

23:59.920 --> 24:02.590
showed their
ugly nature with false accusations.

24:02.590 --> 24:03.750
What examiner in the world,

24:03.750 --> 24:04.920
upon seeing such students,

24:04.920 --> 24:06.470
wouldn't fail them both?

24:07.100 --> 24:08.880
Aren't you afraid
Grandmother might get angry

24:08.880 --> 24:10.140
and drive you away too?

24:20.640 --> 24:22.640
You're banking on me to protect you,

24:22.750 --> 24:23.550
right?

24:24.440 --> 24:25.110
You are the most deceptive man

24:25.110 --> 24:26.480
I have ever met.

24:27.180 --> 24:29.040
Your truth is mixed with lies,
and your lies are mixed with truth.

24:29.040 --> 24:30.880
There isn't
a single honest word from your mouth.

24:30.880 --> 24:31.750
Perhaps even this injury

24:31.750 --> 24:32.950
was part of your plan.

24:33.850 --> 24:35.110
Why don't you stand up?

24:35.120 --> 24:35.710
I...

24:41.000 --> 24:42.920
It was a lie that my life was in danger,

24:42.920 --> 24:44.760
but it was true that I sacrificed myself
to get the target.

24:44.760 --> 24:46.720
You saw
the wound with your own eyes, Miss Rong.

24:46.720 --> 24:47.850
How could it be fake?

24:49.270 --> 24:51.670
I sacrificed myself
all for you, Miss Rong.

24:51.720 --> 24:54.000
It's one thing for you not to thank me,

24:55.200 --> 24:57.530
but how can you
bring yourself to blame me?

25:27.810 --> 25:29.520
With those two nuisances gone,

25:29.520 --> 25:31.120
no one will stand in your way.

25:31.180 --> 25:32.480
Miss Rong, you'll be free

25:32.480 --> 25:34.210
to choose a husband as you wish.

25:45.360 --> 25:46.160
I understand.

25:49.530 --> 25:51.530
Then I wish Miss Rong

25:51.820 --> 25:54.380
to find a good match
and success in all things.

26:06.620 --> 26:08.290
What should I say about you?

26:10.640 --> 26:11.970
How can you still smile?

26:13.430 --> 26:15.030
What being aloof and free?

26:15.240 --> 26:16.780
I think you're just lazy and negligent.

26:16.780 --> 26:18.250
Look at all of them,

26:18.280 --> 26:20.310
using every trick they could think of

26:20.310 --> 26:22.510
and make every effort to win her favour.

26:22.920 --> 26:24.670
You're always so passive,

26:24.790 --> 26:25.720
when will Bao

26:25.720 --> 26:27.380
ever see your good qualities?

26:27.910 --> 26:29.730
If I were truly
a good match for Miss Rong,

26:29.730 --> 26:30.610
and even if I were just

26:30.610 --> 26:32.050
a silent and motionless stone,

26:32.050 --> 26:33.610
when she grows tired from walking,

26:33.610 --> 26:35.680
she would still stop to lean against me.

26:35.680 --> 26:36.810
If I were not for her,

26:37.060 --> 26:38.030
and even if I were to

26:38.030 --> 26:39.790
attend to her every need daily,

26:39.840 --> 26:41.180
trying everything to please her,

26:41.180 --> 26:43.200
it'd be like
pouring cold water on stone.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.790
Even a thousand years of devotion

26:44.790 --> 26:46.050
would still be in vain.

26:48.840 --> 26:51.470
Go away, leave.
Your presence irritates me.

26:56.870 --> 26:58.070
Take care, Lady Rong.

27:07.550 --> 27:08.240
Lady Rong,

27:08.420 --> 27:09.580
I think that Lu guy

27:09.610 --> 27:11.210
isn't one to behave himself.

27:11.270 --> 27:12.920
Since Bao likes him,

27:13.260 --> 27:15.460
let's keep him and observe more for now.

27:15.920 --> 27:17.470
I watched her grow up.

27:18.110 --> 27:20.320
She's always been obedient and sensible.

27:20.320 --> 27:21.760
She knows what matters.

27:23.590 --> 27:24.480
If there's anyone to blame,

27:24.480 --> 27:26.610
blame Bailou for not fighting for her.

27:28.310 --> 27:29.500
I'd like to see

27:30.030 --> 27:31.560
how long he can endure this.

27:32.390 --> 27:32.980
Yes.

27:33.840 --> 27:34.680
Miss Rong

27:34.700 --> 27:36.030
understands your intentions best.

27:36.030 --> 27:38.090
She definitely will not let you down.

27:50.510 --> 27:52.670
I thought I could delay a while longer,

27:53.290 --> 27:55.490
but that damn Lu has ruined everything.

27:56.190 --> 27:59.800
Now I must act earlier.

28:12.080 --> 28:13.200
I failed in my duty to guard,

28:13.200 --> 28:15.060
please forgive me, Young Master!

28:17.950 --> 28:19.560
My little Jifa, stand up.

28:20.550 --> 28:21.200
Get up.

28:24.890 --> 28:26.150
What are you afraid of?

28:26.520 --> 28:28.850
That He Xingming is cunning and ruthless.

28:28.900 --> 28:30.280
After suffering this setback,

28:30.280 --> 28:31.680
he won't let it go easily.

28:32.470 --> 28:34.180
Just keep a close eye on him for me.

28:34.180 --> 28:37.040
Report to me instantly
if anything abnormal happens.

28:37.040 --> 28:38.930
And that'll make up for your mistake.

28:38.930 --> 28:39.480
Yes.

28:40.100 --> 28:41.620
But... But Young Master,

28:42.440 --> 28:43.110
Lady Rong

28:43.110 --> 28:44.730
has already asked you to leave.

28:44.730 --> 28:45.650
Are you really not going back?

28:45.650 --> 28:47.930
Lady Rong hasn't given a final word yet.

28:48.310 --> 28:50.060
There are still three days
until the Tea Ancestor Festival.

28:50.060 --> 28:52.390
Who's the final winner is still a mystery.

29:29.750 --> 29:30.750
What are you up to?

29:42.570 --> 29:43.830
Miss, do you remember?

29:45.440 --> 29:47.030
This is where we first met.

29:48.260 --> 29:50.000
The night was deep and the dew was heavy.

29:50.000 --> 29:50.510
Miss,

29:52.000 --> 29:53.130
you should rest now.

29:54.750 --> 29:55.440
Let's go.

30:37.860 --> 30:39.720
Miss is having nightmares again?

30:42.590 --> 30:43.160
Miss.

31:29.770 --> 31:31.200
-You blind thing!
-Let go!

31:31.200 --> 31:32.660
Watch where you‘re going!

31:34.070 --> 31:34.640
Miss.

31:35.000 --> 31:35.770
Don't be scared.

31:35.770 --> 31:36.940
Mum is here.

31:37.420 --> 31:39.070
Who's there? Breaking in at night!

31:39.070 --> 31:40.470
You frightened our Miss.

31:43.710 --> 31:44.600
Who are you?

31:44.830 --> 31:45.610
I'm not finished questioning you.

31:45.610 --> 31:47.610
-What are you running for?
-Go away!

31:50.320 --> 31:51.270
Go! Hurry!

32:01.630 --> 32:03.090
In the middle of the night,

32:03.640 --> 32:04.200
Mr. Yang,

32:04.200 --> 32:05.960
you're chasing after my little sister.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.490
What exactly are you doing?

32:12.260 --> 32:13.860
Miss Rong, please calm down.

32:14.120 --> 32:15.000
That He guy

32:15.000 --> 32:16.690
was acting suspiciously at night.

32:16.690 --> 32:17.770
I was following him

32:17.800 --> 32:19.070
and entered this garden.

32:19.070 --> 32:20.880
I wanted to catch the intruder for you.

32:20.880 --> 32:22.030
But who knew this guy

32:22.310 --> 32:24.310
just vanished in the blink of an eye?

32:27.720 --> 32:28.350
Miss Rong,

32:28.830 --> 32:30.400
not even a "thank you'?

32:30.510 --> 32:32.440
I was sincerely trying to help you.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.240
Mr. Yang, please.

32:55.460 --> 32:57.190
My respects to you, Young Miss.

33:15.830 --> 33:17.270
Has anyone come by tonight?

33:17.270 --> 33:18.440
We've been standing guard as ordered

33:18.440 --> 33:20.240
and haven't seen any strangers.

33:24.200 --> 33:24.800
Miss Rong,

33:25.030 --> 33:26.170
we've searched around the tea forest

33:26.170 --> 33:27.700
but found no trace of Mr. He.

33:27.960 --> 33:28.550
Miss.

33:29.310 --> 33:31.860
It must be Yang Dingchen,
bitter about being expelled.

33:31.860 --> 33:32.840
So he's deliberately causing trouble

33:32.840 --> 33:34.640
and trying to implicate others.

33:34.910 --> 33:36.440
Whether it's true or false,

33:37.030 --> 33:38.550
before the Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony,

33:38.550 --> 33:40.300
anyone who dares
approach the Tea King Tree,

33:40.300 --> 33:41.560
no matter who they are,

33:41.790 --> 33:43.330
will be arrested and punished.

33:43.330 --> 33:43.930
Yes.

33:52.120 --> 33:54.290
No, there is still one more place.

34:08.030 --> 34:08.780
Young Master.

34:08.780 --> 34:09.630
It was the Rong family

34:09.630 --> 34:11.630
who stole our Huqiu Tea's business.

34:12.190 --> 34:14.070
I'm the one who took your business.

34:14.070 --> 34:16.800
If you want revenge,
come after me, Rong Shanbao.

34:17.030 --> 34:19.290
It has nothing to do with my Grandmother.

34:19.489 --> 34:21.090
You lost fair and square.

34:21.800 --> 34:23.510
Coming here to make trouble?

34:23.980 --> 34:25.780
Even I feel embarrassed for you.

34:27.900 --> 34:29.010
Rong Shanbao.

34:29.860 --> 34:31.989
If this grievance can't be unraveled,

34:32.070 --> 34:34.070
nor a bond forged through marriage,

34:34.280 --> 34:36.480
then I'd rather be your lifelong enemy.

34:37.710 --> 34:39.460
You forced me to do this.

34:44.699 --> 34:45.610
Mr. He.

34:59.550 --> 35:00.150
Well,

35:01.080 --> 35:03.010
Mr. Lu can't sleep either at night,

35:03.590 --> 35:05.000
so you're taking a moonlit stroll?

35:05.000 --> 35:07.200
The tea trees in this garden thrive well

35:07.330 --> 35:08.510
thanks entirely to
the Four-Eyed Sweetwater

35:08.510 --> 35:10.310
ancient well in this old estate.

35:10.670 --> 35:12.530
Especially this Dragon Eye well,

35:12.590 --> 35:15.020
whose water
is crystal clear and inexhaustible,

35:15.020 --> 35:17.280
and its sweetness is said to be
unmatched in the world.

35:17.280 --> 35:19.280
Even the most precious tea cultivars

35:19.280 --> 35:20.280
transplanted from a thousand miles away

35:20.280 --> 35:22.260
can take root
within seven days when irrigated with it.

35:22.260 --> 35:23.940
I fear someone with ill intent

35:24.240 --> 35:26.870
might come skulking
in the dead of night to do mischief.

35:26.870 --> 35:28.610
If the Dragon Eye is ever damaged,

35:28.610 --> 35:30.870
forget about the precious Tea King Tree,

35:30.890 --> 35:33.490
but the entire
tea plantation would be ruined.

35:35.470 --> 35:36.280
What are you hiding

35:36.280 --> 35:37.140
in your sleeve?

35:39.290 --> 35:40.890
Come closer and check it out.

35:52.750 --> 35:53.760
Who's there?

36:04.080 --> 36:04.850
Let me go!

36:17.600 --> 36:19.440
You dare undermine
the root of the Rong family,

36:19.440 --> 36:21.900
and you think
you can walk out of here intact?

36:22.830 --> 36:24.430
Do you want to know what I did?

36:25.870 --> 36:27.080
There're so many things in this world

36:27.080 --> 36:28.960
that can make tea trees die of disease.

36:28.960 --> 36:29.710
I guarantee the officials

36:29.710 --> 36:31.370
won't be able to figure it out.

36:31.410 --> 36:31.960
However,

36:32.740 --> 36:34.200
I have an antidote myself.

36:39.090 --> 36:40.150
Tell me your price.

36:41.640 --> 36:42.480
I want

36:44.730 --> 36:46.370
to share your bed.

36:49.850 --> 36:50.510
Shut up!

36:56.900 --> 36:59.010
Rong Shanbao, how about it?

36:59.840 --> 37:01.300
Have you made up your mind?

37:01.320 --> 37:03.000
You claim to
love the tea plantation above all else

37:03.000 --> 37:04.480
and always put your family first.

37:04.480 --> 37:06.770
What difference does it make
who you're with?

37:06.770 --> 37:08.710
When it comes to
intelligence, strategy,

37:08.710 --> 37:09.790
martial skills, and abilities,

37:09.790 --> 37:11.050
I'm ten thousand times

37:11.150 --> 37:12.800
better than your cousin.

37:14.440 --> 37:15.570
And that Lu Fusheng,

37:15.850 --> 37:17.110
who does he think he is?

37:17.590 --> 37:18.630
Why he can,

37:18.810 --> 37:19.930
but I can't?

37:21.320 --> 37:22.780
How dare you humiliate me?

37:22.930 --> 37:24.590
You'd better decide quickly,

37:24.990 --> 37:25.960
or all the tea plants

37:25.960 --> 37:26.800
will die.

37:26.800 --> 37:29.130
Even if
you grew a thousand eyes and hands,

37:29.280 --> 37:31.010
you couldn't save them in time.

37:31.440 --> 37:32.770
Send word immediately.

37:33.070 --> 37:34.840
Seal all the wells in the estate.

37:34.840 --> 37:38.040
From tomorrow,
bring water from outside for irrigation.

37:40.630 --> 37:41.320
So be it.

37:42.070 --> 37:43.110
I'm the only one

37:43.400 --> 37:45.130
who can make Miss Rong hate with

37:46.410 --> 37:47.760
such piercing agony,

37:47.760 --> 37:49.110
yet remain beyond your power to kill.

37:49.110 --> 37:50.370
I could even say this is your unique,

37:50.370 --> 37:51.430
perverse form of favor,

37:51.430 --> 37:54.090
which is something
others could never achieve.

37:54.920 --> 37:56.960
For that, I have gotten my worth's fill.

37:56.960 --> 37:58.030
In my life,

37:58.370 --> 38:00.370
I hate being threatened most of all.

38:00.440 --> 38:02.510
Mr. He is very drunk tonight.

38:02.890 --> 38:04.090
I'll leave him to you.

38:04.390 --> 38:05.920
Help him sober up properly.

38:06.770 --> 38:09.160
Rong Shanbao! Rong Shanbao!

38:11.920 --> 38:14.590
Hurry! Let me go!

38:14.830 --> 38:16.360
Sure, right away.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.240
Gag his mouth.

38:18.390 --> 38:19.150
-Yes.
-Yes.

38:19.150 --> 38:20.210
What are you doing?

38:21.550 --> 38:22.240
Let me go!

38:28.160 --> 38:30.290
You don't understand her temperament

38:30.760 --> 38:32.280
nor your own heart.

38:34.040 --> 38:35.730
No wonder despite all your advantages,

38:35.730 --> 38:37.390
you still failed completely.

38:39.610 --> 38:40.500
Poor man.

38:46.070 --> 38:46.840
Lu Fusheng!

38:48.510 --> 38:49.280
Lu Fusheng!

38:50.330 --> 38:51.000
Let me go!

38:51.810 --> 38:52.710
Lu Fusheng!

38:52.900 --> 38:56.320
[Rong Mansion]

39:08.320 --> 39:10.110
Fortunately, we discovered it in time

39:10.110 --> 39:11.510
before disaster struck.

39:11.880 --> 39:13.710
Now it's pouring outside,

39:14.650 --> 39:17.070
and he's still abandoned
in the tea plantation.

39:17.070 --> 39:17.800
What if...

39:19.360 --> 39:20.070
That is a

39:20.070 --> 39:22.470
hundred-year-old Longjing Tea Tree King.

39:23.230 --> 39:24.960
Every year,
Grandmother leads us in personally

39:24.960 --> 39:26.690
picking and processing the tea

39:27.230 --> 39:29.560
to be presented as tribute to His Majesty.

39:30.070 --> 39:31.130
It's imperial tea?

39:31.730 --> 39:33.590
It's more than just imperial tea.

39:34.150 --> 39:35.280
Three days from now,

39:35.590 --> 39:37.000
Grandmother will be under that tree

39:37.000 --> 39:38.630
paying tribute to the Tea Ancestor.

39:38.630 --> 39:39.840
This day is also the most

39:39.840 --> 39:41.770
important day of our tea business.

39:42.340 --> 39:44.000
If you had been half a step late tonight,

39:44.000 --> 39:45.280
the hopes of thousands of tea farmers

39:45.280 --> 39:47.540
would have been destroyed in an instant.

39:48.190 --> 39:50.390
How malicious
this man's intention is!

39:50.500 --> 39:52.030
The He family has shown
good will repeatedly

39:52.030 --> 39:54.290
and voluntarily sent him for selection.

39:54.670 --> 39:56.520
Grandmother also wanted
to take this opportunity

39:56.520 --> 39:58.480
to end the feud and reconcile.

39:58.950 --> 40:01.610
Who knew
He Xingming harbored evil intentions?

40:01.950 --> 40:03.680
If he really succeeded in this,

40:03.960 --> 40:05.170
the Rong and He families

40:05.170 --> 40:07.300
would be locked in a fight to the death.

40:07.550 --> 40:08.360
Right now,

40:08.920 --> 40:10.800
we're just making him suffer a little.

40:10.800 --> 40:12.330
I've already been lenient.

40:13.440 --> 40:14.730
Everyone says Miss Rong

40:14.730 --> 40:16.030
was born to have the "Tea Bone".

40:16.030 --> 40:17.370
When the Tea King Tree was in trouble,

40:17.370 --> 40:19.710
Miss Rong could sense it
before anyone else,

40:19.710 --> 40:21.590
and turn misfortune
into good fortune in times of crisis.

40:21.590 --> 40:22.650
This is a good omen.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.550
On the day of the Tea Ancestor Ceremony,

40:24.550 --> 40:26.610
everything will surely go smoothly.

40:34.400 --> 40:35.360
Let's hope so.

40:46.210 --> 40:47.270
It's getting late.

40:47.630 --> 40:49.230
You should rest early, Miss.

41:13.710 --> 41:14.840
Rong Shanbao...

41:15.710 --> 41:18.110
Sooner or later,
you'll fall into my hands.

41:18.440 --> 41:19.710
You'll beg for death

41:20.000 --> 41:21.030
in dire pain.

41:22.030 --> 41:23.800
You can never get rid of me.

41:24.480 --> 41:26.150
I'll never let you go.

41:26.880 --> 41:28.940
Even I become a ghost, I'll haunt you.

41:29.400 --> 41:31.150
Rong Shanbao...

44:23.050 --> 44:25.480
[Tea King Tree Sacrifice]

44:25.510 --> 44:27.110
Before the Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony,

44:27.110 --> 44:28.840
anyone who dares to approach
the Tea King Tree,

44:28.840 --> 44:30.100
no matter who they are,

44:30.230 --> 44:31.960
will be arrested and punished.

44:32.930 --> 44:33.790
Our Rong family

44:33.800 --> 44:34.550
has planted

44:34.570 --> 44:36.510
a Tea King Tree that's over 100 years old.

44:36.510 --> 44:38.280
In today's tea industry,

44:38.400 --> 44:39.920
many places still preserve

44:39.920 --> 44:41.550
ancestral Tea King Trees.

44:42.000 --> 44:43.190
For example, in Zhenyuan, Pu'er,

44:43.190 --> 44:44.230
there's a 2,700-year-old

44:44.230 --> 44:45.440
wild Tea King Tree.

44:45.590 --> 44:46.960
In West Lake's Longjing Village,

44:46.960 --> 44:49.240
there're 18 Tea King Trees
designated by Emperor Qianlong.

44:49.240 --> 44:52.210
And the Mother Tree Da Hongpao
in Wuyi Mountain, and so on.

44:52.210 --> 44:53.710
Tea farmers in some regions

44:53.710 --> 44:55.030
even hold annual ceremonies

44:55.030 --> 44:57.520
during specific seasons
or before and after tea picking

44:57.520 --> 44:58.960
in front of these Tea King Trees

44:58.960 --> 45:01.120
to worship and pray for blessings.

45:01.430 --> 45:03.070
They pray for abundant tea harvests

45:03.070 --> 45:04.630
and smooth picking processes.

45:04.630 --> 45:06.190
For instance, tea farmers in Wuyi Mountain

45:06.190 --> 45:07.710
hold a mountain-calling ceremony

45:07.710 --> 45:10.570
every year during
the Awakening of Insects season.

45:10.630 --> 45:11.830
The tea is sprouting!

45:12.510 --> 45:13.920
Before Grain Rain,
when it's time to pick tea,

45:13.920 --> 45:15.450
they shout together again:

45:15.630 --> 45:16.670
Time to pick tea!

45:17.280 --> 45:17.710
This set of rituals

45:17.710 --> 45:19.620
passed down from the Five Dynasties
and Ten Kingdoms period

45:19.620 --> 45:21.070
is the mountain-opening tea ceremony,

45:21.070 --> 45:22.750
which has been preserved until today.

45:22.750 --> 45:23.920
As for the Zhenyuan area in Pu'er

45:23.920 --> 45:26.000
with its 2,700-year-old Tea King Tree,

45:26.000 --> 45:27.710
generations of local tea farmers
and merchants

45:27.710 --> 45:29.800
also offer incense and wine to it.

45:29.800 --> 45:30.710
They sing blessings for it

45:30.710 --> 45:31.590
with utmost devotion.
